Spec: Application package

Purpose:
  The `aikana` Python package. It wires the models, authentication and calendar views together into a FastHTML app
  and provides the entry point that serves it.

Structure:
  ./__init__.py: package marker
  ./main.py: creates the FastHTML app and serves it, binds to the `$PORT` environment variable
  ./layout.py: shared page shell with the header, Tailwind Play CDN script and HTMX
  ./models.py: database setup and models
  ./auth.py: login, logout and the admin guard
  ./semester_view.py: semester wall planner view
  ./course_view.py: per-course calendar view
  ./day_dialog.py: admin dialog and day cell fragments

Owns:
  ./__init__.py
  ./main.py
  ./layout.py

Must:
  `python -m aikana.main` starts the server on the port given by `$PORT`, defaulting to `8000`.
  Each module has a same-basename spec in this directory when it has substantial behavior.
  Views render for unauthenticated visitors without any editing affordances.

Tasks:
  [ ] Create ./layout.py with the shared page shell
